  WebgpuShaderProcessorWGSL
    ✔ inserts generated declarations after WGSL directives
    ✔ generates dual-source fragment outputs
    sample_mask builtin
      ✔ adds the sample_mask output when the shader assigns it
      ✔ does not add the sample_mask output for a comparison
      ✔ combines fragDepth and sample_mask outputs
      ✔ adds the sample_mask fragment input when read through the input struct
      ✔ adds the sample_mask fragment input when read through the private global
      ✔ does not add the sample_mask fragment input when unused

  WebgpuShaderProcessorWGSL - compute reflection
    ✔ reflects a read_write storage buffer (regex fix)
    ✔ reflects a read-only storage buffer
    ✔ reflects a texture and its sampler (two slots)
    ✔ detects unfilterable-float (uff) textures
    ✔ collapses loose uniforms into a single uniform buffer and renames access
    ✔ combines storage buffers, a texture, and uniforms in one reflected group
    ✔ uses group 0 when no caller bind group format is supplied
    ✔ is a no-op when there is nothing to reflect (strictly additive)
    ✔ ignores workgroup, private and local variables
    ✔ reflects a write-only storage texture
    ✔ round-trips a read_write storage texture
    ✔ reflects a sampled texture + sampler + storage texture (edge-detect layout, group 0)
    ✔ reflects the particles-simulation pattern (loose uniforms + rw/ro storage, group 0)
    ✔ leaves explicitly-bound resources untouched while reflecting simplified ones
    ✔ does not fabricate a sampler when a texture is the last declared resource
    ✔ reflects a multisampled color texture without a sampler
    ✔ reflects a multisampled depth texture
    ✔ maps integer component types on a multisampled color texture


